          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"/openings/2/text\",\"value_json\":\"Aunt Juniper was waiting at the hill foot with a sore knee. “Quiet, please,” she said, while Tomas dreamed of a daring hilltop picnic. Moss hoped nobody would treat him like a cart. Lila tucked a paper crown under her arm and began inventing a kinder sort of celebration.\"},{\"path\":\"/scenes/20/variants/0\",\"value_json\":\"{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lila tied the brass bell to Moss’s harness. He gave one careful step, but for Juniper’s quiet celebration, the bell stayed still against his shoulder. Moss looked wonderfully grand.\\\",\\\"when\\\":[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"bell.owner\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"moss\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"juniper.wish\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"quiet\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"}]}\"},{\"path\":\"/scenes/20/variants/-\",\"value_json\":\"{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lila tied the brass bell to Moss’s harness. He gave one testing step, and the bell answered, ding!\\\",\\\"when\\\":[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"bell.owner\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"moss\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"juniper.wish\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"ne\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"quiet\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"}]}\"},{\"path\":\"/scenes/21/variants/0\",\"value_json\":\"{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Moss led the one-bundle procession to Juniper with his head held high. He stopped beside her and waited. Juniper smiled, and the hill seemed to hold its breath around their tiny, quiet celebration.\\\",\\\"when\\\":[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"moss.procession\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":true,\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"juniper.wish\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"quiet\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"}]}\"},{\"path\":\"/scenes/21/variants/-\",\"value_json\":\"{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Moss led the one-bundle procession to Juniper, bell chiming at his shoulder. He stopped beside her and lifted his nose, waiting. Tomas began clapping first.\\\",\\\"when\\\":[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"moss.procession\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":true,\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"},{\\\"key\\\":\\\"juniper.wish\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"ne\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"quiet\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"after\\\"}]}\"},{\"path\":\"/endings/1/text\",\"value_json\":\"At the hilltop, Aunt Juniper laughed beside Lila as the bell’s tiny notes rolled toward the empty plates. Tomas waved from the path below, and the sunny slope glittered with crumbs.\"}]}",
          "type": "output_text",
          "logprobs": []
        }
